ng></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Important Question</strong></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Q. Has the Bihar BPSC AES Admit Card 2026 been released?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Yes the Bihar BPSC AES Admit Card 2026 has been released.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. When was the Bihar BPSC AES Admit Card 2026 officially announced?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>The Bihar BPSC AES Admit Card 2026 has issued on 04 June 2026 by BPSC.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. When will the Bihar BPSC AES Exam be held?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> The Bihar BPSC AES examination will be conducted on <strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"226\">11 June 2026</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. Where can I check the Bihar BPSC AES Admit Card 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>You can check it on the official BPSC website: https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/</p>\n<p><strong>Q. What should I search on the website to find the Bihar BPSC AES Admit Card 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;Look for&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"797\">“Admit Card – Bihar BPSC AES Recruitment 2025”</strong>&nbsp;in the notifications list.</p>\n<p><span data-teams=\"true\"><strong>Q. What details are required to download the admit card?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Candidates need their&nbsp;<strong>Registration Number / Roll Number</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Password / Captcha</strong>&nbsp;to download the admit card<strong>.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is BPSC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of BPSC is https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
